## Next build (1.0.1) — force update after it is live

`app.json` / `package.json` marketing version is **`1.0.1`**. EAS production `autoIncrement` (remote source) assigns native builds. A second Android production build landed on **27** (user, 2026-10-01).

| Platform | Build to require | Firestore field to set after it is installable |
|----------|------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| **Android** | versionCode **27** | `minAndroidVersionCode: 27` |
| **iOS** | buildNumber **33** (next production build from 32, unless rebuilt higher) | `minIosBuildNumber: 33` |

Also set `minAppVersion: "1.0.1"` only after **both** stores the user cares about are serving 1.0.1. Setting any of these mins earlier blocks current installs with no newer build to download.

